 guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_name": "Newverse Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://people.rit.edu/cxpigm/newverse/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Newverse Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://people.rit.edu/cxpigm/newverse/EllicsExerciseClass.html", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "937029436987366"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oc